flowchart TD
    A[Paperless import]:::paperless --> B{Page needs OCR?}:::paperless
    B -- No --> C[Keep native text path]:::paperless
    B -- Yes --> D[OCRmyPDF rasterizes page]:::paperless
    D --> E[paperless-local-ai OCR plugin]:::local
    E --> F[PaddleOCR · PP-OCRv6]:::local
    F --> G[Searchable Paperless archive / content]:::paperless
    C --> G
    G --> H[Document Added workflow · classification queue]:::paperless
    H --> I{Tagging strategy}:::local
    I -- Hybrid tagging --> J{Similarity + neighbor agreement pass?}:::local
    J -- Yes --> K[Fix reviewed tag locally]:::local
    J -- No --> L[LLM fallback · Tag Guidance + reviewed examples]:::local
    I -- LLM direct --> M[LLM chooses tags directly]:::local
    K --> N[LLM · System + Base prompt · no tags schema]:::local
    L --> O[LLM · System + Base + Tagging prompt]:::local
    M --> O
    N --> P[Local correspondent resolver]:::local
    O --> P
    P --> Q{Sender resolution}:::local
    Q -- Existing safe match --> R[Apply existing correspondent]:::local
    Q -- Plausible new sender --> S[Paperless Document Suggestions]:::paperless
    Q -- Empty / unreliable --> T[Leave correspondent empty]:::local
    R --> U[Apply metadata + review]:::paperless
    S --> U
    T --> U

    classDef paperless fill:#173A5E,stroke:#6EA8D9,color:#FFFFFF,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef local fill:#174D3B,stroke:#66C59A,color:#FFFFFF,stroke-width:2px;
